        "node_id": "n_5_081a05",
        "thought_text": "To improve efficiency while avoiding the error, we can implement a greedy algorithm that always chooses the longest available segment. This approach may not always yield the optimal solution but could be faster for larger inputs. We should also modify the polygon_area function to correctly calculate the area of any polygon, not just triangles.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-2275174459842953945",
